<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 127,421.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 127,421.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against NYCE's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 10 totaled 127,421 bales, down from 135,252 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, no decertification orders, and 7,831 cancellations .</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
